       -> §8\n#--   Ch 7 §2 unschedulable Pods as Cluster Autoscaler's trigger  -> §7\n#--   Ch 13 §7 metrics-server as the HPA's input                  -> §7\n#--   Ch 10 §3 \"object without its component\" -> VPA, BY NAME     -> §7\n#--   Ch 14 §6 CRDs shipped as chart content                      -> §4\n=== HEADINGS ===\n290:## *\"Meshes, functions, autoscalers, and the foundation that keeps the map\"*\n300:## Attention Budget\n338:## 🧭 Soundings\n397:## Why This Chapter Matters\n421:## What You'll Learn\n436:## ⚪ §1 — What \"Cloud Native\" Actually Names\n511:## ⚪ §2 — Sandbox, Incubating, Graduated, and Who Decides\n631:## 🔵 §3 — Small Pieces, Replaced Whole\n685:## ☆ Taking Your Bearings: The Definition, the Ladder, and Who Decides\n783:## 🔵 §4 — Every Place Kubernetes Lets You In\n882:## 🟡 §5 — A Network That Knows What It's Carrying\n1053:## ☆ Taking Your Bearings: Extension Points, and the Layer That Knows What It's Carrying\n1158:## 🔵 §6 — Code Without a Server to Put It On\n1260:## 🔵 §7 — Four Things That Scale\n1393:## ⚪ §8 — How the Project Actually Runs, and How You'd Join\n1576:## ☆ Taking Your Bearings: Scaling, Serverless, and How the Project Runs\n1675:## ☀️ §9 — One Pluggability Story\n1729:## Exam Alert! 🚨\n1771:## Practice Questions\n2000:## Chapter Summary\n2024:## 🏆 Safe Harbor\n2032:## The Voyage Ahead","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
